{"acoustic-vs-digital-piano-comparison-chart": [900, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:900px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">Side by side</div><h1>Acoustic vs digital piano at a glance</h1><div class=\"card\" style=\"overflow:hidden\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#15191c;color:#fff\"><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;font-size:16px\">Factor</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;font-size:19px\">Acoustic piano</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;font-size:19px\">Digital piano</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Sound</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">Strings and soundboard resonate together <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">Sampled or modelled sound through speakers</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Touch</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">Real hammer action, very fine control <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">Weighted hammer action; good models feel close</td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Starting price</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">Good new upright: about $3,500 to $10,000</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">Good beginner digital: about $400 to $700 <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Upkeep</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">Tuning about twice a year, steady humidity</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">Dusting. No tuning, ever <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Volume</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">Loud; some uprights have a practice mute</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">Volume control and headphones <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Size and weight</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">Upright: about 300 to 800 lb</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">Portable: about 25 to 40 lb <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Moving</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">Needs professional piano movers</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">One or two people <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Extras</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">None (it is just a piano)</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">Metronome, recording, Bluetooth, apps <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid #d9e2e5\"><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;width:190px\">Lifespan and resale</td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;background:#eaf5ef;font-weight:600\">Decades with care; keeps more value <span style=\"color:#1f7a4d;font-family:Schibsted Grotesk;font-weight:800\">\u2713</span></td><td style=\"padding:11px 14px;font-size:17px;font-family:Lora,serif;line-height:1.35;\">Electronics age; resale drops fast</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 18px;font-size:18px\"><b style=\"color:#2e6475\">Acoustic wins 3:</b> sound, touch, lifespan.</div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:14px 18px;font-size:18px\"><b style=\"color:#2e6475\">Digital wins 6:</b> price, upkeep, volume, size, moving, extras.</div></div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Typical ranges; prices in US dollars, October 2026</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"], "how-acoustic-and-digital-pianos-make-sound": [860, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:860px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">How they work</div><h1>How each piano makes its sound</h1><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px\">\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:22px 24px\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#b86a0a\">ACOUSTIC PIANO</div><div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:800;margin:4px 0 16px\">Wood, felt and steel</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">1</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Key</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">You press the key, which works as a lever.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#f6b31e;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">2</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Hammer</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">A felt hammer flies up and strikes the strings.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#f6b31e;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">3</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Strings</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Steel strings vibrate; the damper lifts to let them ring.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#f6b31e;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">4</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Soundboard</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">A large wooden board amplifies the vibration.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#f6b31e;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6b31e;color:#1b1400;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">5</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Your ears</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Sound fills the room, with real resonance from every string.</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:22px 24px\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#2e6475\">DIGITAL PIANO</div><div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:800;margin:4px 0 16px\">Sensors and samples</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">1</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Key</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">A weighted key copies the feel of a hammer action.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#2e6475;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">2</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Sensors</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Two or three sensors per key measure how fast it moved.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#2e6475;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">3</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Sound engine</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Chooses the matching recording, or models the string.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#2e6475;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">4</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Amplifier</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">Turns the signal into sound at the volume you set.</div></div></div><div style=\"width:3px;height:16px;background:#2e6475;margin-left:22px;opacity:.5\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><div style=\"flex:none;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#2e6475;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:20px\">5</div><div><div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:800\">Speakers or headphones</div><div style=\"font-size:16.5px;font-family:Lora,serif;color:#33424a;line-height:1.35\">The room, or only you, hears it.</div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px;padding:14px 20px;font-size:18px;background:#fff8e6\">The difference you hear: an acoustic's untouched strings vibrate in sympathy. Better digitals simulate this \"string resonance\"; cheaper ones don't.</div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Pianoers.com \u00b7 Acoustic vs digital piano</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"], "acoustic-vs-digital-piano-10-year-cost": [770, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&family=Noto+Music&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nbody{width:1200px;height:770px;font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f6f7;color:#15191c;padding:52px 60px 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.eyebrow{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2e6475}\nh1{font-size:48px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 26px}\n.foot{position:absolute;left:60px;right:60px;bottom:20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:17px;color:#56666e;font-weight:500}\n.foot b{letter-spacing:.12em;color:#2e6475}\n.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e2e5;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(21 25 28/6%),0 8px 24px rgb(21 25 28/6%)}\nsvg text{font-family:\"Schibsted Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif}\n.mus{font-family:\"Noto Music\",serif}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"eyebrow\">Cost of ownership</div><h1>What each piano costs over 10 years</h1><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:22px 26px\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin:14px 0\"><div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">Digital, beginner</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#56666e\">$500 piano + $150 stand, bench and pedal</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\"><div style=\"height:46px;width:6.5%;min-width:8px;background:#2e6475;border-radius:10px\"></div><b style=\"font-size:24px;white-space:nowrap\">$650</b></div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin:14px 0\"><div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">Digital, console</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#56666e\">$2,000, no upkeep</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\"><div style=\"height:46px;width:20.0%;min-width:8px;background:#2e6475;border-radius:10px\"></div><b style=\"font-size:24px;white-space:nowrap\">$2,000</b></div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin:14px 0\"><div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">Used upright</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#56666e\">$2,000 + $300 move + 20 tunings</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\"><div style=\"height:46px;width:53.0%;min-width:8px;background:#f6b31e;border-radius:10px\"></div><b style=\"font-size:24px;white-space:nowrap\">$5,300</b></div></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin:14px 0\"><div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">New upright</div><div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#56666e\">$6,000 + $300 move + 22 tunings</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\"><div style=\"height:46px;width:96.0%;min-width:8px;background:#f6b31e;border-radius:10px\"></div><b style=\"font-size:24px;white-space:nowrap\">$9,600</b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px;padding:16px 20px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5\"><b>Assumptions:</b> tuning at $150 a visit; 3 to 4 tunings in a new piano's first year, then 2 a year (Piano Technicians Guild guidance); one local move. Not included: repairs, humidity control, or resale, where a well-kept acoustic gets more back.</div><div class=\"foot\"><span>Example totals in US dollars; your prices will vary</span><b>PIANOERS.COM</b></div></body></html>"], "piano-size-and-weight-comparison": [640, "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@500;700;800&family=Lora:ital,wg